# (build 145) The teleport clerk's portrait (portrait 30, teleport_clerk)
# in Paseo's teleport station (Building_TeleportStation), from its picture:
# one of the twelve no route drew after build 142 (see
# paseo_hospital_picture). A new game knows no other town, so the clerk
# says so ($0C03, three pages) and "come again later" ($0C04), and the
# party is let out.

start building 15 30 0 0 7 18       # the station; the street is 7,18
wait idle
expect script $0C01                 # "Welcome to the Teleport Station!"
expect picture 56 64 teleport_clerk
shot 01_teleport_clerk
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $0C03
expect script $0C04
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 7 18
expect picture 56 64 none
expect no-stderr not ported
